      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it guarantee that both intent will be sent in this order ?\n\nIf not, this test will fail as per current implementation of the abstraction.\n\nI would propose to do a different abstraction, to use like this (open discussion)\n\n```\nFoo Bonding \u003d new IntentMatcher(sTargetContext, ACTION_BOND_STATE_CHANGED, {EXTRA_BOND_STATE, BOND_BONDING}, {EXTRA_DEVICE, mBumbleDevice})\nFoo PairingRequest \u003d new IntentMatcher(sTargetContext, ACTION_PAIRING_REQUEST, {EXTRA_PAIRING_VARIANT, PAIRING_VARIANT_CONSENT}, {EXTRA_DEVICE, mBumbleDevice})\n\nassertThat(mBumbleDevice.createBond()).isTrue();\n\nBonding.waitAndAssert(TIMEOUT_MS)\nPairingRequest.waitAndAssert(TIMEOUT_MS)\n\nmBumbleDevice.setPairingConfirmation(true);\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 153,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 162,
        "endChar": 81
